{#
| Variable                    | Type   | Description                                                   |
|-----------------------------|--------|---------------------------------------------------------------|
| component.title_line1       | string | the headline's first line, the logo beside it                 |
| component.title_logo        | string | that logo; empty → the pink قصة logo (images/qhero)            |
| component.title_line2       | string | the headline's second line                                    |
| component.subheading        | string | the text under the headline on desktop and tablets            |
| component.subheading_mobile | string | the text under the headline on phones                         |
| component.image             | string | the products photo, 1386 × 832; empty → the theme's own       |
| component.image_mobile      | string | phones, 964 × 580; empty → component.image, else the theme's  |
| component.link              | string | optional: the photo opens it                                  |
| position                    | int    | sorting block                                                 |

Qissa Hero — Figma «Qusah Re-Vamp» 803:727: desktop 802:645 (1400 × 745), phones 806:678 (374 × 500).
A navy panel lit by two soft beams from its top corners; the headline (its first line beside the pink logo),
the text, then the products photo standing on the panel's foot. As the page's first block the navbar rides on
the panel's top (qissa-header.scss), so the panel keeps the frame's room for it (qissa-hero.scss).
#}
{% set logo = component.title_logo ?: ('images/qhero/qusah-pink.svg'|asset) %}
{% set img = component.image ?: ('images/qhero/products-1386.webp'|asset) %}
{% set img_m = component.image_mobile ?: (component.image ?: ('images/qhero/products-964.webp'|asset)) %}
{% set media_tag = component.link ? 'a' : 'div' %}

<section class="s-block qissa-hero" id="qissa-hero-{{ position }}">
    <div class="qissa-hero__panel">
        {# the beams: Figma's own blurred ellipses (802:646 / 802:647, phones 803:704 / 806:680) #}
        <span class="qissa-hero__beam qissa-hero__beam--l" aria-hidden="true"><span><img src="{{ 'images/qhero/beam-l.svg'|asset }}" alt="" width="1354" height="254"/></span></span>
        <span class="qissa-hero__beam qissa-hero__beam--r" aria-hidden="true"><span><img src="{{ 'images/qhero/beam-r.svg'|asset }}" alt="" width="1360" height="254"/></span></span>
        <span class="qissa-hero__beam qissa-hero__beam--ml" aria-hidden="true"><span><img src="{{ 'images/qhero/beam-m-l.svg'|asset }}" alt="" width="841" height="254"/></span></span>
        <span class="qissa-hero__beam qissa-hero__beam--mr" aria-hidden="true"><span><img src="{{ 'images/qhero/beam-m-r.svg'|asset }}" alt="" width="753" height="254"/></span></span>

        <div class="qissa-hero__copy">
            <h1 class="qissa-hero__title">
                <span class="qissa-hero__line qissa-hero__line--logo">
                    {% if component.title_line1 %}<span>{{ component.title_line1 }}</span>{% endif %}
                    <img class="qissa-hero__logo" src="{{ logo }}" alt="{{ store.name }}" width="84" height="32"/>
                </span>
                {% if component.title_line2 %}<span class="qissa-hero__line">{{ component.title_line2 }}</span>{% endif %}
            </h1>
            {% if component.subheading %}<p class="qissa-hero__text qissa-hero__text--desktop">{{ component.subheading }}</p>{% endif %}
            {% if component.subheading_mobile %}<p class="qissa-hero__text qissa-hero__text--mobile">{{ component.subheading_mobile }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>

        <{{ media_tag }} class="qissa-hero__media"{% if component.link %} href="{{ component.link }}" aria-label="{{ (component.title_line1 ~ ' ' ~ component.title_line2)|trim|default(store.name) }}"{% endif %}>
            {# the light behind the products: Figma's «Ellipse 11» (802:699), hidden in the file, shown at the
               client's ask (8 Nov 2026) #}
            <img class="qissa-hero__glow" src="{{ 'images/qhero/glow.svg'|asset }}" alt="" width="1254" height="1254"/>
            {# the page's largest paint on every screen: never lazy, fetched first #}
            <picture>
                <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="{{ img_m }}" width="964" height="580"/>
                <img class="qissa-hero__img" src="{{ img }}" alt="" width="1386" height="832" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"/>
            </picture>
        </{{ media_tag }}>
    </div>
</section>
